# L §5.14.3 (writer 8): an adjustment has "the attributes adjusts ... and change"; of_leg is gone (the leg is in the
# change's name, adjustments[m[keys].leg, V]); L §2.2 lists `adjusts change` as the attributes of adjustments. a.of_leg
# is no field: LOAD-FIELD.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind waivers: event certain
input wd: date

move wv[a in adjustments on wd where a.of_leg == "cash"]: waivers
  on a.day
  fulfils a
=== expect
refused: LOAD-FIELD ...
